  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Tập xác định của hàm số là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>\\</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝒟</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝒟</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>tan</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>tan</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>tan</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> là hàm số tuần hoàn.</li><li>Hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có tập xác định là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>ℝ</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tDo đó, hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hàm số tuần hoàn.</li></ol>",
